abstract: >-
  Executable theorem laboratories for adelic reconstruction, arithmetic
  sensing and observability, operational information geometry, certified
  query-directed experimental design, deterministic tapered quadrature, exact
  continuum positivity, a proof-aware nonlinear double-pendulum benchmark,
  and a discrete Global Geometry programme for studying how compatible local
  rules generate, program, and reveal global metric, curvature, topology, and
  scale-dependent dimension.
keywords:
  - discrete differential geometry
  - local-to-global emergence
  - spectral dimension
  - computational mathematics
  - reproducible research software
